        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 3:07AM EDT until September 27 at 4:00AM EDT by NWS Melbourne FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT... North to northeast winds around 15 knots with gusts 20
to 25 knots. Seas 6 to 9 feet.

* WHERE...Sebastian Inlet to Jupiter Inlet 0-20 nm, Flagler
Beach to Volusia-Brevard County Line 20-60 nm, Volusia-Brevard
County Line to Sebastian Inlet 20-60 nm and Sebastian Inlet to
Jupiter Inlet 20-60 nm.

* WHEN...Until 4 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
